===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|haw|'ōhai||{{taxlink|Sesbania tomentosa|species}}}}, {{cog|ty|ofai||''[[Sesbania grandiflora]]''}} and {{cog|mqm|kohai||{{taxlink|Caesalpinia pulcherrima|species}}}} from {{inh|mi|poz-pol-pro|*kōfai}}.<ref>{{cite-web|title=Kōfai|work=Te Māra Reo: The Language Garden|year=2022|publisher=Benton Family Trust|url=https://www.temarareo.org/PPN-Kofai.html}}</ref>

